hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1074.1","Yahya narrated to me from Malik, from Ayyub ibn Musa, from Mansur ibn Abd ar-Rahman al-Hajabi, from his mother, from A'ishah, the Mother of the Believers, may Allah be pleased with her, that she was asked about a man who said, \"My wealth is dedicated to the covering of the Ka'bah.\" She said, \"What expiates for an oath will expiate for it.\" Malik said concerning one who says, \"My wealth is dedicated to the cause of Allah,\" and then breaks his oath, \"He should dedicate a third of his wealth to the cause of Allah, and that is based on what has been transmitted from the Messenger of Allah ﷺ concerning the affair of Abu Lubabah.\""
"1074.2","Yahya narrated to me from Malik, from Muhammad ibn Yahya ibn Habban, from al-A'raj, from Abu Hurayrah, that the Messenger of Allah ﷺ said: None of you should propose to a woman while his brother is already engaged to her."
"1075.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Qabisa ibn Dhu'ayba that Umar ibn al-Khattab gave the grandfather \"\"what people give him today"
"1075.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Qabisa ibn Dhu'ayba that Umar ibn al-Khattab gave the grandfather \"\"what people give him today"
"1076.1","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Sulayman ibn Yasar said"
"1076.2","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Sulayman ibn Yasar said"
"1077.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Uthman ibn Ishaq ibn Kharasha that Qabisa ibn Dhu'ayb said"
"1077.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Uthman ibn Ishaq ibn Kharasha that Qabisa ibn Dhu'ayb said"
"1078.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that al-Qasim ibn Muhammad said"
"1078.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that al-Qasim ibn Muhammad said"
"1079.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdu Rabbih ibn Said that Abu Bakr ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn al-Harith ibn Hisham only gave a fixed share to two grandmothers (together). Malik said"
"1079.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdu Rabbih ibn Said that Abu Bakr ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn al-Harith ibn Hisham only gave a fixed share to two grandmothers (together). Malik said"
"1080.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam that Umar ibn al-Khattab asked the Messenger of Allah"
"1080.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam that Umar ibn al-Khattab asked the Messenger of Allah"
"1081.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Muhammad ibn Abi Bakr ibn Muhammad ibn Amribn Hazm that Abdar-Rahman ibn Hanthala az-Zurqi was informed by a mawla of Quraysh"
"1081.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Muhammad ibn Abi Bakr ibn Muhammad ibn Amribn Hazm that Abdar-Rahman ibn Hanthala az-Zurqi was informed by a mawla of Quraysh"
"1082.1","Yahya related to me from Malik that Muhammad ibn Abi Bakr ibn Hazm heard his father say many times"
"1082.2","Yahya related to me from Malik that Muhammad ibn Abi Bakr ibn Hazm heard his father say many times"
"1083.1",""
"1083.2",""
"1084.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that Ali ibn Husayn ibn Ali ibn Abi Talib told him that Aqil and Talib inherited from Abu Talib"
"1084.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that Ali ibn Husayn ibn Ali ibn Abi Talib told him that Aqil and Talib inherited from Abu Talib"
"1085.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said from Sulayman ibn Yasar that Muhammad ibn al-Ashath told him that he had a christian or jewish paternal aunt who died. Muhammad ibn al-Ashath mentioned that to Umar ibn al-Khattab and said to him"
"1085.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said from Sulayman ibn Yasar that Muhammad ibn al-Ashath told him that he had a christian or jewish paternal aunt who died. Muhammad ibn al-Ashath mentioned that to Umar ibn al-Khattab and said to him"
"1086.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said from Ismail ibn Abi Hakim that Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz freed a christian who then died. Ismail said"
"1086.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said from Ismail ibn Abi Hakim that Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz freed a christian who then died. Ismail said"
"1087.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from a reliable source of his who had heard Said ibn al-Musayyab say"
"1087.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from a reliable source of his who had heard Said ibn al-Musayyab say"
"1088.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Rabia ibn Abi Abd ar-Rahman from more than one of the people of knowledge of that time"
"1088.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Rabia ibn Abi Abd ar-Rahman from more than one of the people of knowledge of that time"
"1089.1","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Urwa ibn az-Zubayr said about the child of lian and the child of fornication"
"1089.2","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Urwa ibn az-Zubayr said about the child of lian and the child of fornication"
